    "UIName": "JagerMech JM6-DD",
    "Id": "mechdef_jagermech_JM6-DD",
    "Name": "JagerMech JM6-DD",
    "Details": "The DD was the first variant incorporating technology recovered from the Gray Death Memory Core. The DD replaces the standard engine with an XL model and converts the armor to ferro-fibrous, adding an additional half-ton. The Mydron Medium Autocannons are replaced by General Motors Nova-5 Ultra Autocannons, and the Magna standard lasers are replaced with Sutel Precision Line Medium Pulse Lasers. CASE is mounted in both side torsos to protect the ammunition, with the AC/2 ammunition doubled and moved into these side torsos to take advantage of this. The original design's single heat sinks are retained.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_jagermech"
  },
